{"id":"n26701-1-13","stage":2,"title":"운행 · 运行","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26701-1-13-1","ko":"한참을 기다렸는데 버스가 왜 안 오지?","zh":"等了这么久，公交车怎么还不来啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한참을","meaning":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","explanation":"한참：一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한참","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72463","senseId":"1","lemma":"한참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한참을","audio":"/audio/6cd5b498744bcc06ea06.mp3"}},{"text":"기다렸는데","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다렸는데","audio":"/audio/f7e9f42e92a55b7b17f8.mp3"}},{"text":"버스가","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스가","audio":"/audio/4a5fae1e77392a579e0a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"오지?","meaning":"来，开来","explanation":"오다：来，开来；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","sen