"text":"운행이","meaning":"运行","explanation":"운행：运行；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운행","audio":"/audio/ab412cb5392fee6bc17b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26701","senseId":"1","lemma":"운행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운행이","audio":"/audio/e975faefe873de49d63b.mp3"}},{"text":"끝났을","meaning":"结束，完","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"2","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝났을","audio":"/audio/d8ab0b202db938ea0c59.mp3"}},{"text":"수도","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수도","audio":"/audio/b42d1b5bced00efc95ca.mp3"}},{"text":"있겠다.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있겠다","audio":"/audio/6e792c6008a1cd1801aa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ab412cb5392fee6b","term":"운행","zh":"运行","audio":"/audio/ab412cb5392fee6bc17b.mp3","entryId":"26701","definition":"汽车或列车按照规定的路线行驶。","pronunciation":["운ː행"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"规定的时间全都过去。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a4e031e179dae6c092f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26701","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.4003,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在这个时间，公交车可能已经停运了。","看看这张照片。这是我们家的狗狗。","等了这么久，公交车怎么还不来啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在这个时间，公交车可能已经停运了。","等了这么久，公交车怎么还不来啊？","看看这张照片。这是我们家的狗狗。"],"answer":0}]}
